{
  "$comment": "Shared golden vectors. Source of truth: TwinRocket/meshloom-community docs/contracts/vectors/golden.json. Copies elsewhere carry the sha256 of this file and must be refreshed, never edited. Expected values come from an independent reference written from the rules below, then checked against every implementation.",
  "version": 1,
  "packet_hash": {
    "rule": "header = raw[0]; route_type = header & 3; payload_type = (header >> 2) & 15. Skip 4 transport-code bytes when route_type is 0 or 3. path_byte: mode = path_byte >> 6 (3 is reserved -> invalid), hops = path_byte & 63, path length = hops * (mode + 1) <= 64. At least one payload byte must follow the path. hash = SHA-256(payload_type byte [+ path_byte as 2-byte little-endian when payload_type == 9 TRACE] + payload), first 16 hex digits, uppercase. Any invalid or empty input -> 16 zeros (DROP).",
    "cases": [
